      "worked": "The total frequency is $46$. The sum of the data values is\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum fx&=0\\times5+1\\times2+2\\times0+3\\times7+4\\times1+5\\times8\\\\&\\quad+6\\times4+7\\times6+8\\times0+9\\times2+10\\times11\\\\\\sum fx&=261\\\\\\overline{x}&=\\frac{261}{46}\\\\\\overline{x}&\\approx5.7\\quad\\text{(1 decimal place)}\\end{align*}$$\nThe greatest frequency is $11$, belonging to value $10$, so the mode is $10$.\n\nThe cumulative frequencies for values $0$ to $10$ are $5,7,7,14,15,23,27,33,33,35,46$. The 23rd value is $5$ and the 24th is $6$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{5+6}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=5.5\\end{align*}$$\nEach half contains $23$ values. The lower quartile is the 12th value overall, and the upper quartile is the 35th value overall.\n$$\\begin{align*}Q_1&=3\\\\Q_3&=9\\\\\\text{IQR}&=9-3\\\\\\text{IQR}&=6\\end{align*}$$",
